id: UCB-286-P0
title: Abort the UCB validate worker when the 2 s timeout fires.
status: closed
priority: P0
description: |
  Product hole: UCB 2.8.5 attach hardening for the named hole in live aep-ucb. The 2 s validate timeout returns while the blocking worker can keep running. Abort or isolate that worker so a flood cannot occupy the pool. Ticket close is coding close.
  Applicable plan: UCB-286-ATTACH-HARDENING-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN
track: aep28-ucb-hardening
wave: hardening
plan: UCB-286-ATTACH-HARDENING-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN
